          "id": 814250196,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "In the http2 case `data` is a `http_message_info_t` from `dissect_multipart()`, and in `dissect_dtap()` data is handled as `sccp_msg_info_t`. This does not work very good because then `sccp_assoc` may have some strange pointers.",
